Native Windows setup: see README.WINDOWS.md for the detailed build, PowerShell,
PATH, verification, update and uninstall guide. The Linux/Mac instructions below
are retained from upstream.

For an automated Windows source build and Program Files installation, see
build-install-windows.bat and the automated-build section in README.WINDOWS.md.
Run the batch file as administrator for the default machine-wide installation.

ADMIXTOOLS version 5.0  6/28/18 (for Linux and Mac)

Best is to recompile on your system. 

You will need to be able to link GNU Scientific library(gsl) , BLAS, gfortran, and prpbably lapack.  
This Makefile expects opeenblas but other versions of BLAS should be OK.  Edit the Makefile 
appropriately.

cd src;  make clobber; make all; make install.  Eexcutables will be in ../bin

A Makefile that worked for a Mac (El Capitan) is in src/Makefile.mac

Nick Patterson
